    {
      "module_id": "ch08-m10",
      "objective_id": "ch08-m10-R1",
      "original_text": "但问题是：早在 2012 年 Google Glass 就尝试过了，最后失败了。为什么十几年后，大家又觉得自己能做成？",
      "source": {
        "relative_path": "第8章-产品密谈/8.10-为什么大厂都在重新押注AI眼镜？.md",
        "content_hash": "d6b68f73783d86e7baa257445caecb061e27be116f08e8115c08108b02086d93",
        "line_start": 9,
        "line_end": 9
      },
      "disposition": "合并",
      "reason": "历史成败因果不背定论，转化为当下同任务增量价值和可佩戴性的可检验解释。",
      "actual_card_keys": [
        "ch08.interview.m10.wearability-tradeoff.001",
        "ch08.interview.m10.incremental-value-test.001"
